  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"toc\"><div class=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Level Thresholds</b></span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Overview</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>How Level Thresholds Work</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Types of Supplies Rewarded</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Level Threshold Placement</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Conclusion</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Level Thresholds</b></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Overview</b></span></h3>\n<p>In <i>Hay Day</i>, level thresholds are specific XP milestones within a level where players receive special supplies such as <a href=\"/wiki/axe-3051\" title=\"Axe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">axes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/dynamite-3037\" title=\"Dynamite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dynamite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saws</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/shovel-3036\" title=\"Shovel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shovels</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/tnt-barrel-3038\" title=\"TNT Barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TNT barrels</a>., and barn or silo upgrade materials. These thresholds serve as bonus rewards to aid in farm expansion and storage improvements\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>How Level Thresholds Work</b></span></h3>\n<p>As players accumulate XP within a level, they will reach predefined XP checkpoints where they receive supply rewards. These rewards are automatically added to the player's inventory and can significantly help with expanding land, increasing barn and silo capacity, or unlocking special areas.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Types of Supplies Rewarded</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Land Expansion Items</b>: <a href=\"/wiki/land-deed-14138\" title=\"Land Deed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">land deeds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mallet-14140\" title=\"Mallet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mallets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/map-piece-13240\" title=\"Map Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">map pieces</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/marker-stake-14141\" title=\"Marker Stake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">marker stakes</a> , and <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-permit-27088\" title=\"Expansion Permit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion permits</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Building supplies</b>: <a href=\"/wiki/bolt-3342\" title=\"Bolt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bolts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/brick-13236\" title=\"Brick\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">brick</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/duct-tape-2920\" title=\"Duct Tape\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duct tape</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hammers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/hand-drill-13235\" title=\"Hand Drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hand drills</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nails</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/paint-bucket-13234\" title=\"Paint Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">paint buckets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/plank-3343\" title=\"Plank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">planks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/screw-6711\" title=\"Screw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">screws</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">stone blocks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tar buckets</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wood panels</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Mining supplies</b>: <a href=\"/wiki/dynamite-3037\" title=\"Dynamite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dynamite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/shovel-3036\" title=\"Shovel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shovels</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tnt-barrel-3038\" title=\"TNT Barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TNT barrels</a> , and <a href=\"/wiki/pickaxe-14244\" title=\"Pickaxe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pickaxes</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Land-clearing supplies</b>: <a href=\"/wiki/axe-3051\" title=\"Axe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">axes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/dynamite-3037\" title=\"Dynamite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dynamite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saws</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/shovel-3036\" title=\"Shovel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shovels</a> , and <a href=\"/wiki/tnt-barrel-3038\" title=\"TNT Barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TNT barrels</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Level Threshold Placement</b></span></h3>\n<p>Level thresholds are spaced throughout the XP range of a level. They become more frequent at higher levels, where XP requirements increase. While the exact placement varies, players can expect to receive multiple supply rewards before fully leveling up.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Conclusion</b></span></h3>\n<p>Level thresholds in <i>Hay Day</i> provide players with essential supplies as they progress within a level. Understanding these checkpoints and maximizing XP gain helps in efficient farm management, ensuring a steady flow of expansion materials and upgrades.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<caption>Numbers of thresholds\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>15-24\n</th>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>25-39\n</th>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>40-59\n</th>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>60-84\n</th>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>85+\n</th>\n<td>5\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831183437\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 48/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36283-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831183437 and revision id 107498. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
